# Asleep in bed (issue 034, redrawn in 052): the full 80x96 bed-made (5x6) with the head resting on the west pillow (hair, face, closed eyes) and the covers pulled up over connected shoulders and a body-shaped bulge down to the feet; the duvet stripes carry on over it. Replaces the bed sprite while sleeping.
